t Locker<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><!--]--><!--]--></ul><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="canigetnextdaydeliverywithevrisdoortodoorcourierservice-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-canigetnextdaydeliverywithevrisdoortodoorcourierservice" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-canigetnextdaydeliverywithevrisdoortodoorcourierservice" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Can I get Next Day delivery with Evri’s door-to-door Courier service?-open answer" data-test-id="canigetnextdaydeliverywithevrisdoortodoorcourierservice-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="canigetnextdaydeliverywithevrisdoortodoorcourierservice-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Can I get Next Day delivery with Evri’s door-to-door Courier service?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-canigetnextdaydeliverywithevrisdoortodoorcourierservice" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-canigetnextdaydeliverywithevrisdoortodoorcourierservice" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="canigetnextdaydeliverywithevrisdoortodoorcourierservice-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Sadly, we can’t offer Next Day delivery with our standard, door-to-door <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><a href="/courier-service" rel="noreferrer"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Courier collection service<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->. Instead, all Next Day delivery parcels need to be dropped off at your nearest ParcelShop or Locker before noon in order to qualify for this sending option.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="whattimewillmynextdaydeliveryarrive-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-whattimewillmynextdaydeliveryarrive" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-whattimewillmynextdaydeliveryarrive" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-What time will my Next Day delivery arrive?-open answer" data-test-id="whattimewillmynextdaydeliveryarrive-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="whattimewillmynextdaydeliveryarrive-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>What time will my Next Day delivery arrive?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52