elivery",[32],{"type":33,"text":34,"spans":35},"paragraph","Enjoy cheap Next Day delivery costs starting from £3.20!",[],"Send a UK parcel",{"link_type":38,"key":39,"url":40},"Web","a4f29f5e-fd5d-4361-b7cb-2b07e06643c4","next-day-parcel-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend",null,{"link_type":43},"Any",{"dimensions":45,"alt":48,"copyright":41,"url":49,"id":50,"edit":51},{"width":46,"height":47},300,45,"Next Day","next-day-parcel-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F41d15a31-f912-400d-bacd-599c7473fe32_next_day.svg","YhYpMRIAACgA0QB5",{"x":52,"y":52,"zoom":53,"background":54},0,1,"#fff",{},{"link_type":18},"page_header$a4297249-4756-4e7e-80e7-562ec1f0c758","page_header",{"variation":60,"version":25,"items":61,"primary":62,"id":119,"slice_type":120,"slice_label":41},"fullWidthBanner",[],{"theme":63,"show_premium_logo":20,"label":41,"label_theme":64,"titleH2":65,"bodyText":66,"image":106,"rightImage":20,"buttonText":36,"buttonLink":116,"buttonDataGtmTrack":41,"primary_button_external":20,"button_secondary":118,"secondary_button_external":20},"neutral","Core","Easy Next Day parcel delivery",[67,71,84,87,96,101],{"type":33,"text":68,"spans":69,"direction":70},"If you’re looking to send a parcel with Next Day delivery anywhere in the UK, Evri is right here to lend a hand!",[],"ltr",{"type":33,"text":72,"spans":73,"direction":70},"Whether you choose to send through our ParcelShops or Lockers is up to you. Simply drop your parcel off before 12pm and our Couriers will aim to deliver to your recipient the following day!",[74,78,81],{"start":75,"end":76,"type":77},39,50,"strong",{"start":79,"end":80,"type":77},54,61,{"start":82,"end":83,"type":77},111,115,{"type":33,"text":85,"spans":86,"direction":70},"You can choose from two options to book your Next Day delivery:",[],{"type":88,"text":89,"spans":90,"direction":70},"list-item","Book online – Use our website or mobile App to book and pay for your Next Day delivery. Print your label off at home or in-store for free using our Print In ParcelShop devices. Choose to drop off your parcel at your nearest ParcelShop or Locker - we'll take care of things from there.",[91,93],{"start":52,"end":92,"type":77},13,{"start":94,"end":95,"type":77},148,175,{"type":88,"text":97,"spans":98,"direction":70},"Book in a ParcelShop – Prefer to book parcels in person? Take your wrapped parcel to a participating Post Office. A member of staff will help take you through all the steps needed to book your Next Day delivery with us and we'll send your parcel on its way.",[99],{"start":52,"end":100,"type":77},20,{"type":33,"text":102,"spans":103,"direction":70},"Ready to get started? Find your nearest ParcelShop or Locker today and book your parcel for delivery.",[104],{"start":105,"end":76,"type":77},22,{"dimensions":107,"alt":110,"copyright":41,"url":111,"id":112,"edit":113},{"width":108,"height":109},1000,667,"ParcelShop store assistant is smiling and handing a blue receipt to the customer to confirm that their parcels have been accepted.","next-day-parcel-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJCZbqstJ9-Tfj_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2610.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=47%2C0%2C5906%2C3939&w=1000&h=667","Z6TJCZbqstJ9-Tfj",{"x":114,"y":52,"zoom":53,"background":115},47,"transparent",{"link_type":38,"key":117,"url":40},"4362dd02-5f1e-45af-8787-28b1468cb2e9",{"link_type":43},"landing_feature_banner$c5e2a204-6f31-4f06-8adb-803d0a958475","landing_feature_banner",{"variation":122,"version":25,"items":123,"primary":125,"id":137,"slice_type":138,"slice_label":41},"default",[124],{},{"sectionTitle":41,"sectionDescription":41,"sectionBackgroundColor":126,"widgetPromoText":41,"widgetHeading":127,"widgetHeadingSupplement":41,"widgetSubheading":128,"footerLinks":129,"nextDay":136},"dark-navy","Send Next Day parcels from only £3.20","We offer cheap Next Day delivery costs as low as £3.20 (£2.67 + VAT), meaning you can get your parcel where it needs to go for as l