"primary":380,"id":383,"slice_type":384,"slice_label":41},"listComponent",[303,316,325,336,347,358,369],{"title":304,"content":305,"icon":309},"End-to-end tracking over the course of your parcel’s delivery",[306],{"type":33,"text":307,"spans":308},"",[],{"dimensions":310,"alt":312,"copyright":41,"url":313,"id":314,"edit":315},{"width":311,"height":311},40,"Track location icon","next-day-parcel-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8b145688-a43b-4d6e-b22c-b7b556cc29a2_track.svg","Yh96FRIAACgA-Zrj",{"x":52,"y":52,"zoom":53,"background":54},{"title":317,"content":318,"icon":319},"A 1-hour delivery window on the day of your parcel’s delivery, so you can be in to collect it",[],{"dimensions":320,"alt":321,"copyright":41,"url":322,"id":323,"edit":324},{"width":311,"height":311},"Icon of a clock","next-day-parcel-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F40f1b5ea-7a5c-44d7-8e16-86d427c88a1d_its_too_late1.svg","Yh96GBIAACoA-Zsp",{"x":52,"y":52,"zoom":53,"background":54},{"title":326,"content":327,"icon":330},"Delivery to a recipient’s home, office, or most convenient ParcelShop",[328],{"type":33,"text":307,"spans":329},[],{"dimensions":331,"alt":332,"copyright":41,"url":333,"id":334,"edit":335},{"width":311,"height":311},"Parcelshop icon","next-day-parcel-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F6fb8763e-f02b-40b7-8e67-a916528bac93_parcelshop.svg","Yh96GBIAAC0A-Zsl",{"x":52,"y":52,"zoom":53,"background":54},{"title":337,"content":338,"icon":341},"3 delivery attempts before a parcel is sent to its nearest ParcelShop",[339],{"type":33,"text":307,"spans":340},[],{"dimensions":342,"alt":343,"copyright":41,"url":344,"id":345,"edit":346},{"width":311,"height":311},"Courier icon","next-day-parcel-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F41cd86aa-f6de-4624-bc9c-90ec921f0ed2_courier2.svg","Yh96FRIAACwA-Zrk",{"x":52,"y":52,"zoom":53,"background":54},{"title":348,"content":349,"icon":352},"The option to divert a parcel to a safe place or neighbour before delivery",[350],{"type":33,"text":307,"spans":351},[],{"dimensions":353,"alt":354,"copyright":41,"url":355,"id":356,"edit":357},{"width":311,"height":311},"Neighbour icon","next-day-parcel-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F3736a9dc-2f90-4270-886c-46497bea535b_neighbour.svg","YeXP6xEAACIAnAxo",{"x":52,"y":52,"zoom":53,"background":54},{"title":359,"content":360,"icon":363},"Delivery photo confirmation, so you know your parcel was delivered",[361],{"type":33,"text":307,"spans":362},[],{"dimensions":364,"alt":365,"copyright":41,"url":366,"id":367,"edit":368},{"width":311,"height":311},"Camera icon","next-day-parcel-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F9ecd696f-d8c8-4a09-bdab-f2ed97d94895_cameras.svg","Yh96GBIAACkA-Zso",{"x":52,"y":52,"zoom":53,"background":54},{"title":370,"content":371,"icon":374},"£20 FREE parcel cover (excludes Postable parcels)",[372],{"type":33,"text":307,"spans":373},[],{"dimensions":375,"alt":376,"copyright":41,"url":377,"id":378,"edit":379},{"width":311,"height":311},"Money icon","next-day-parcel-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F41d7371a-386e-4d75-a28e-2ea118d1d0af_money.svg","Yh96FxIAAC8A-Zsd",{"x":52,"y":52,"zoom":53,"background":54},{"theme":29,"title":381,"description":382},"Why use Evri’s Next Day Courier service?","No matter the value of your parcel, with our Next Day UK delivery service, you’ll benefit from all of these extras, for free:","list_block$d3ecf008-6511-4b8b-be25-2780175caca5","list_block",{"variation":386,"version":25,"items":387,"primary":406,"id":409,"slice_type":384,"slice_label":41},"listNoIcon",[388,391,394,397,400,403],{"title":389,"content":390,"isNumbered":136},"Find a suitable box or bag that fits your item",[],{"title":392,"content":393,"isNumbered":136},"Wrap the item you’re sending in bubble wrap",[],{"title":395,"content":396,"isNumbered":136},"Place your item in its packing and pack any remaining space",[],{"title":398,"content":399,"isNumbered":136},"Securely fasten all sides and corners of your parcel with packing tape",[],{"title":401,"content":402,"isNumbered":136},"Label your package correctly and clearly",[],{"title":404,"content":405,"isNumbered":136},"Book your delivery online, through our mobile app, or in one of our ParcelShops and drop your parcel off before noon",[],{"theme":29,"title":407,"description":408,"showPaddingTop":20},"How to pack Next Day delivery parcels","If you’re looking to send a parcel with Next Day delivery, you want to be sure it’s packaged correctly to ensure it reaches its destination safely. Make sure this is the case by following these simple parcel-packing steps:","list_block$804fdb2f-64f0-4bfd-98d0-3a0c75a93aa7",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":411,"primary":448,"id":450,"slice_type":451,"slice_label":41},[412,430,442],{"questionTitle":413,"questionBody":414},"Can I change my delivery location if I’m not going to be in?",[415,418,421,424,427],{"type":33,"text":416,"spans":417},"Yes. If you’re expecting a Next Day parcel delivery but won’t be in to meet your Courier, you can redirect up to 15 minutes ahead of your scheduled delivery to any of the following locations:",[],{"type":88,"text":419,"spans":420},"Your designated safe place",[],{"type":88,"text":422,"spans":423},"Your preferred neighbour",[],{"type":88,"text":425,"spans":426},"Your nearest ParcelShop",[],{"type":88,"text":428,"spans":429},"Your nearest Locker",[],{"questionTitle":431,"questionBody":432},"Can I get Next Day delivery with Evri’s door-to-door Courier service?",[433],{"type":33,"text":434,"spans":435},"Sadly, we can’t offer Next Day delivery with our standard, door-to-door Courier collection service. Instead, all Next Day delivery parcels need to be dropped off at your nearest ParcelShop or Locker before noon in order to qualify for this sending option.",[436,439],{"start":437,"end":438,"type":77},72,98,{"start":437,"end":438,"type":236,"data":440},{"link_type":38,"url":441},"next-day-parcel-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service",{"questionTitle":443,"questionBody":444},"What time will my Next Day delivery arrive?",[445],{"type":33,"text":446,"spans":447},"Our standard weekday delivery times are between 8am and 8pm. We’ll also make sure to text you on the day with a 1-hour delivery window to let you know roughly when your parcel will be delivered. This gives you plenty of time to redirect your parcel if you need to.",[],{"title":449},"Next Day parcel delivery FAQs","frequently_asked_questions$f3cdfb51-1d8d-438f-b2a4-b54c7a019307","frequently_asked_questions",[23,59,121,139,189,251,269,300,385,410],{"footerLinks":454},[455,467],{"link":456,"text":466},{"id":457,"type":458,"tags":459,"lang":15,"slug":460,"first_publication_date":461,"last_publication_date":462,"uid":463,"url":464,"link_type":18,"key":465,"isBroken":20},"YhZhMBIAACgA0bfU","content-page",[179],"uk-destinations","2022-02-23T16:30:45+0000","2025-10-14T10:34:12+0000","what-i-can-and-cannot-send","\u002Fsend\u002Fwhat-i-can-and-cannot-send","5625a966-9b93-4207-a890-55281b9b7524","Check our prohibited items",{"link":468,"text":477},{"id":469,"type":458,"tags":470,"lang":15,"slug":471,"first_publication_date":472,"last_publication_date":473,"uid":474,"url":475,"link_type":18,"key":476,"isBroken":20},"YihsQxIAACsAIcAj",[179],"parcel-size--weight-guide--how-to-measure--weigh-a-parcel--evri","2022-03-09T08:59:08+0000","2026-07-09T07:02:15+0000","parcel-size-and-weight-guide","\u002Fsend\u002Fparcel-size-and-weight-guide","839df39f-33df-4559-a17f-dedee5b1cab5","Parcel size and weight guide",["Reactive",479],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":480,"$sclients":546,"$sglobal-basket-count":41,"$sglobal-user-postcode":307},{"abtasty":481,"accessibe":484,"appPromoBanner":487,"autoDivertUpdates":490,"awin":493,"bulkInternational":496,"bulkSe